# KATOMIA-CONFIG1 (user 2026-07-14): site-wide, non-secret config (landing page's
# curated game list, later default skin/branding for white-label editions) —
# deliberately git-tracked so it's administrable/reviewable like any other code,
# unlike the blanket *.json rule above (which exists for build/cache noise).
!/public_html/m/katomia/site-config.json
# QA-UXGRID1 (2026-07-16): the QA data layer is deliberately git-tracked —
# JSON as source of truth under change control is the entire design (test
# cases/dimensions/canaries edited and reviewed like code). Same rationale
# as KATOMIA-CONFIG1 above.
!/public_html/m/katomia/qa/data/**/*.json
# BOARD-ARRANGE1 (2026-07-17): harness move scripts (scripted demo/replay
# inputs) are authored test content — same source-of-truth rationale.
!/public_html/m/katomia/qa/harness/moves/*.json
# 2026-08-08: the test-index viewer. Caught by the blanket `test*` rule above
# (meant for scratch files), which would have silently left the page untracked
# and un-deployable — the same class of miss as the unpublished kwc snapshot
# earlier today: present on the box, invisible everywhere else.
!/public_html/m/katomia/qa/tests.html
